OL,3,GNEWSA'We were trapped in a house that
OL,4,Acould collapse at any moment'
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhen Ryan Ward hired builders for an
OL,7,Fextension to his family home in Leeds
OL,8,Ftwo years ago he never imagined the
OL,9,Fnightmare that would follow.
OL,11,F"We were just trapped in a house that
OL,12,Fcould potentially collapse at any
OL,13,Fmoment, with our children inside," the
OL,14,Fdad-of-two said.
OL,16,FWard was eventually told after weeks of
OL,17,Fdelays, no-shows and deadlines being
OL,18,Fmoved that the builder was on the verge
OL,19,Fof going bankrupt.
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
