OL,3,GNEWSA'We were trapped in a house that
OL,4,Acould collapse at any moment'
OL,5,
OL,6,FHaving already paid about #90,000 for
OL,7,Fthe cellar excavation and extension
OL,8,Fproject, the family were "left out of
OL,9,Fpocket with nobody to turn to".
